    "name": "UNEXPECTED: Cry of the Wild",
    "steam_appid": 3468720,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Waylen, a man whose romantic yacht trip turns into a fight for survival after a devastating storm. Stranded with his girlfriend, he must battle unknown creatures, uncover the island\u2019s secrets, build shelter, and find a way to escape.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468720/extras/f6139e12ef44f8b201794a2dd25ecba4.avif?t=1742577438\" data-has-big width=800 height=400 /></span>The island is infested with terrifying creatures lurking in the shadows, waiting for the perfect moment to strike. Every encounter is a battle for survival\u2014stealth, strategy, and brutal combat are your only chances of making it out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use every weapon at your disposal \u2013 craft makeshift tools, wield deadly melee attacks, or strike from the darkness. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468720/extras/cded64a49fbcb561f6d15bf428a44077.poster.avif?t=1742577438\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468720/extras/cded64a49fbcb561f6d15bf428a44077.webm?t=1742577438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>On this island, the elements are just as deadly as the monsters lurking in the dark. Crafting a shelter isn\u2019t just survival\u2014it\u2019s your only hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find Resources</strong> \u2013 Gather wood, stone, and salvaged materials to build your safe haven.<br><strong>Upgrade &amp; Reinforce</strong> \u2013 Strengthen your shelter to withstand monster attacks and harsh weather.<br><strong>Stay Hidden</strong> \u2013 A well-placed hideout can mean the difference between life and death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is unforgiving. Will your shelter stand the test of time? <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468720/extras/a29ef50518cb18b7dce66bd7b5893337.poster.avif?t=1742577438\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468720/extras/a29ef50518cb18b7dce66bd7b5893337.webm?t=1742577438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>On this island, making a sound could be your last mistake. Every shadow is an opportunity, every noise a risk. Stay silent, stay unseen, and strike only when the moment is right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Move Like a Ghost</strong> \u2013 Crouch, sneak, and blend into the environment to avoid deadly encounters.<br>\u00a0<strong>Strike from the Shadows</strong> \u2013 Take down enemies swiftly before they even know you\u2019re there.<br>\u00a0<strong>Distraction is Key</strong> \u2013 Throw objects, manipulate light, or use the environment to mislead your hunters.<br>\u00a0<strong>Stealth Shelters</strong> \u2013 Build hidden safe zones where monsters can\u2019t track you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the silent survive. Will you master the shadows or fall to the island\u2019s horrors?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468720/extras/97a48b702af94ed541428776715e5c00.poster.avif?t=1742577438\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468720/extras/97a48b702af94ed541428776715e5c00.webm?t=1742577438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
